<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92861" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῡσός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shrivelled, wrinkled</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.503
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				490
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				266
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				452b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥυσὰ σαρκῶν πολιᾶν
			καταδρύμματα</span> the tearing of old <i>wrinkled</i> flesh
			(cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥυτίς</span>), <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				49
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. βουλευτήρια</span>,
			prob. 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥυσοὶ βουλευταί</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Theopomp.Com.
				75
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαστός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.88
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					10.404
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥυσότερον βαλλαντίων πρόσωπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					3.55
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. ἐπισκύνιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.64
				</span></i>
			 (Paul. Sil.); also of fruits, etc., [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρόδρυα] ἰσχνὰ καὶ ῥ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.735d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαῖαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archestr.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῦκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Im.</u>
					1.31
				</span></i>
			.—The forms <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥυσσός,
				ῥυσσαίνομαι</span>, etc., are freq. in codd.</div>
